{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "prose_thozhar_jeeva", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "jeeva_as_writer", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தோழர் ஜீவா சிறந்த பேச்சாளராக மட்டுமன்றி வேறு எத்தகு இலக்கியப் பணிகளை ஆற்றினார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "துப்பறியும் கதைகள் மட்டுமே எழுதினார்", "B": "கவிஞர், மொழிபெயர்ப்பாளர், இதழாசிரியர் மற்றும் இலக்கியத் திறனாய்வாளர்", "C": "எந்த நூலும் எழுதவில்லை", "D": "நாடகங்களை மட்டும் புறக்கணித்தார்"}, "explanation": "ஜீவா சிறந்த கவிஞர்; தாகூரின் கீதாஞ்சலியைத் தமிழாக்கியவர்; இலக்கியத் திறனாய்வாளர்; 'தாமரை', 'ஜனசக்தி' இதழ்களின் ஆசிரியர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Besides legendary oratory, what multidimensional literary roles did Comrade Jeeva fulfill?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Detective fiction writer only", "B": "Poet, translator, editor, and pioneering Marxist literary critic", "C": "Wrote no books", "D": "Boycotted theater"}, "explanation": "He was an accomplished poet, translator of Tagore, literary critic, and journal editor."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "ed