{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q063", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "deception_curtain", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உதாரனும் அமுதவல்லியும் ஒருவரை ஒருவர் பார்த்துவிடக் கூடாது என்பதற்காக மன்னன் மதனமன்னன் செய்த வஞ்சகத் திட்டம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இருவரையும் தனித்தனி அறையில் வைத்தான்", "B": "கண்களைக் கட்டினான்", "C": "நடுவே திரைச்சீலை அமைத்து, \"உதாரன் கண்பார்வையற்ற குருடன்\" என்றும், \"அமுதவல்லி தொழுநோயாளி\" என்றும் ஒருவருக்கொருவர் பொய் கூறினான்", "D": "கடிதங்கள் மூலம் மட்டும் பேசச் சொன்னான்"}, "explanation": "அரசன் உதாரனிடம் 'அமுதவல்லி தொழுநோயாளி' என்றும், அமுதவல்லியிடம் 'உதாரன் பார்வைத்திறனற்ற குருடன்' என்றும் பொய் கூறி இருவருக்கும் இடையே ஒரு திரைச்சீலையைத் தொங்கவிட்டான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What deceitful stratagem did King Madhanamannan devise to prevent Udharan and Amuthavalli from falling in love?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Locked them in separate rooms", "B": "Blindfolded them", "C": "Hung a partition curtain lying to Udharan that she was a leper and to Amuthavalli that he was blind", "D": "Restricted them to written letters"}, "explanation": "He placed a curtain, falsely telling Udharan she had leprosy and Amuthavalli that Udharan was blind."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Poetry", "Puratchikkavi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q064", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "moonlight_poem_discovery", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திரைச்சீலைக்கு அப்பால் இருக்கும் அமுதவல்லிக்கு உதாரன் பார்வையற்றவன் அல்லன் என்னும் உண்மை எப்போது வெளிப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மன்னன் உண்மையைச் சொன்னபோது", "B": "தோழி காட்டிக் கொடுத்தபோது", "C": "புத்தகம் கீழே விழுந்தபோது", "D": "இரவில் முழுநிலவின் அழகைக் கண்டு மெய்மறந்து உதாரன் நிலவைப் பாடிய கவிதையைக் கேட்டபோது"}, "explanation": "வானில் எழுந்த முழுநிலவின் பேரழகைக் கண்டு உதாரன், 'அதோ பார் முழுமதி!' என வியந்து கவிதை பாடியபொழுது, அவன் பார்வையற்றவன் அல்லன் என்பதை அமுதவல்லி உணர்ந்தாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How did Amuthavalli discover the truth that Udharan was not blind?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The king confessed", "B": "Her maid betrayed him", "C": "A dropped manuscript", "D": "Hearing Udharan spontaneously sing an ecstatic lyric celebrating the radiant full moon in the night sky"}, "explanation": "Udharan's spontaneous lyric on the full moon revealed that his vision was perfectly intact."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Poetry", "Puratchikkavi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q065", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "curtain_removal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "உண்மை தெரிந்தவுடன் அமுதவல்லி என்ன செய்தாள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திரைச்சீலையை விலக்கி உதாரனின் பேரழகைக் கண்டு அவன் மீது காதல் கொண்டாள்", "B": "காவலர்களை அழைத்தாள்", "C": "அரண்மனையை விட்டு ஓடினாள்", "D": "உதாரனைத் திட்டினாள்"}, "explanation": "உண்மை உணர்ந்த அமுதவல்லி திரைச்சீலையை விலக்க, உதாரனும் அவளது பேரழகைக் கண்டான்; இருவர் உள்ளத்திலும் உண்மைக் காதல் மலர்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What did Amuthavalli do upon learning the truth?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Parted the curtain and fell in love beholden by Udharan youthful nobility", "B": "Summoned the guards", "C": "Fled the palace", "D": "Rebuked Udharan"}, "explanation": "She pulled aside the curtain, and both immediately fell deeply in love."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "ur