{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q079", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "udharan_courage", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மரண தண்டனை விதிக்கப்பட்டபோதும் உதாரன் அஞ்சாமல் நின்றதன் காரணம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தப்பிக்கும் வழி தெரிந்ததால்", "B": "மன்னன் மன்னிப்பான் என்று நம்பியதால்", "C": "தான் எவ்விதத் தவறும் செய்யவில்லை; தன் காதலும் தூய தமிழ்ப்பற்றும் உண்மையானது என்ற தன்மான உணர்வு இருந்ததால்", "D": "ஆயுதம் வைத்திருந்ததால்"}, "explanation": "உதாரன் சாவைக்கண்டு அஞ்சாத தன்மானமிக்க தமிழ்க் கவிஞனாக, உண்மைக்கும் காதலுக்கும் உயிரைத் தரத் துணிந்து கம்பீரமாக நின்றான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Why did poet Udharan remain completely fearless when sentenced to death?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "He knew an escape route", "B": "He trusted the king would forgive him", "C": "He was steadfast in conscious innocence, unwavering self-respect, and sacred devotion to truth and love", "D": "He possessed hidden weapons"}, "explanation": "His supreme self-respect and the purity of his love made him face the executioner without fear."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Poetry", "Puratchikkavi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q080", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "literary_significance_bilhana_adapt", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாரதிதாசன் வடமொழிக் கதையைத் தமிழில் தழுவியபோது நிகழ்த்திய மாற்றங்களின் முக்கியத்துவம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாத்திரங்களின் எண்ணிக்கையைக் குறைத்தது", "B": "கதையின் காலத்தை மாற்றியது", "C": "இடங்களை மாற்றியது மட்டுமே", "D": "நிலப்பிரபுத்துவக் காதல் கதையை, சாதி எதிர்ப்பு, மொழிப்பற்று, பெண்ணுரிமை, மக்களாட்சி மலர்ச்சி என்னும் முற்போக்கு ஜனநாயகக் காப்பியமாக மாற்றியமைத்த புரட்சி"}, "explanation": "பாரதிதாசன் பழைய நிலப்பிரபுத்துவக் காதல் கதையைத் தமிழ்த் தேசிய, சமதர்ம, குடியரசுப் புரட்சிக் காப்பியமாக உருமாற்றினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What constitutes the ideological significance of Bharathidasan's adaptation of Bilhaneeyam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Reducing character count", "B": "Altering the historical timeline", "C": "Changing locations only", "D": "Radically transforming a feudal romance into an anti-caste, feminist, pro-Tamil republican democratic revolution"}, "explanation": "He revolutionized an aristocratic romance into an egalitarian anti-caste epic of democratic emancipation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Poetry", "Puratchikkavi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q081", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "amuthavalli_chastity_and_valor", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாரதிதாசன் அமுதவல்லியின் பாத்திரத்தை எவ்வாறாகப் படைத்துள்ளார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அடங்கி ஒடுங்கும் பெண்ணாக அன்றி, தன் காதலையும் சுயமரியாதையையும் காக்க மன்னனையும் எதிர்த்து நிற்கும் புரட்சிப் பெண்ணாக", "B": "அஞ்சும் பேதையாக", "C": "தந்தைக்கு அடிபணியும் மகளாக மட்டுமே", "D": "அரசியல் ஆசை கொண்டவளாக"}, "explanation": "அமுதவல்லி பெண் விடுதலையின் குறியீடாக, தன் காதலுக்காக மன்னனின் ஆணையைத் தூக்கியெறிந்து கொலைக்களம் புகும் புரட்சிப் பெண்ணாக மிளிர்கிறாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does Bharathidasan portray Princess Amuthavalli?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Not as submissive, but as a fearless revolutionary woman defying autocratic patriarchy for self-respect and love", "B": "As a frightened maiden", "C": "As a compliant daughter only", "D": "As power-hungry"}, "explanation": "She embodies enlightened womanhood and fearless courage."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Poetry", "Puratchikkavi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q082", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tamil_is_life_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தமிழுக்கும் அமுதென்று பேர் - அந்தத் தமிழின்பத் தமிழெங்கள் உயிருக்கு நேர்' என்னும் அழியாப் பாடலைப் பாடியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பாரதியார்", "B": "பாவேந்தர் பாரதிதாசன்", "C": "வாணிதாசன்", "D": "முடியரசன்"}, "explanation": "இப்புகழ்பெற்ற தமிழ்த்தாய் போற்றுதல் பாடலைப் பாடியவர் பாவேந்தர் பாரதிதாசன் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who sang the immortal anthem 'Thamizhukkum Amuthendru Per - Antha Thamizhinba Thamizhengal Uyirukku Ner'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Bharathiyar", "B": "Paventhar Bharathidasan", "C": "Vanidasan", "D": "Mudiyarasan"}, "explanation": "Composed by Paventhar Bharathidasan."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Poetry", "Bharathidasan"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q083", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "poetry_puratchikkavi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "puratchikkavi_dramatic_conflict", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'புரட்சிக்கவி' காப்பியத்தில் நிலவும் முதன்மையான நாடக முரண் (Dramatic Conflict) எவற்றுக்கு இடையே நிகழ்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கடவுளுக்கும் மனிதனுக்கும் இடையே", "B": "இரண்டு நாடுகளுக்கு இடையே", "C": "கொடுங்கோல் மன்னராட்சி மற்றும் நிலப்பிரபுத்துவச் செருக்குக்கும்; எளிய கவிஞனின் தன்மானம், மக்கள் சக்தி மற்றும் ஜனநாயக விடுதலைக்கும் இடையே", "D": "இயற்கைக்கும் மனிதனுக்கும் இடையே"}, "explanation": "மன்னனின் எதேச்சதிகார வர்க்க ஆணவத்திற்கும், உதாரன் மற்றும் மக்களின் தன்மான ஜனநாயக உரிமைக்கும் இடையே நிகழும் மோதலே இக்காவியத்தின் நாடக முரணாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What constitutes the primary dramatic conflict driving the plot of 'Puratchikkavi'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "God versus mortal", "B": "Inter-state warfare", "C": "Despotic monarchical feudalism vs the proletarian poet dignity, people power, and democratic freedom", "D": "Man versus nature"}, "explanation": "The central conflict is between autocratic feudal tyranny and democratic human dignity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book"