{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q146", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "grammar_aakkappeyarkal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "verb_noun_derivation_types", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆக்கப்பெயர்களை அவற்றின் உற்பத்தி மூலத்தின் அடிப்படையில் இரண்டு பெரும் பிரிவுகளாகப் பிரிக்கலாம். அவை யாவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இடை ஆக்கப்பெயர், உரி ஆக்கப்பெயர்", "B": "பெயர் ஆக்கப்பெயர் (Noun derivatives) மற்றும் வினை ஆக்கப்பெயர் (Verb derivatives)", "C": "சுட்டு ஆக்கப்பெயர், வினா ஆக்கப்பெயர்", "D": "பொருட்பெயர், பண்புப்பெயர்"}, "explanation": "ஆக்கப்பெயர்கள் மூலச்சொல்லின் அடிப்படையில் 'பெயர் ஆக்கப்பெயர்' (பெயர்ச்சொல் + விகுதி: கல்யாணக்காரன், அறிவாளி) மற்றும் 'வினை ஆக்கப்பெயர்' (வினைச்சொல் + விகுதி: ஓட்டுநர், பாவாணர், பெருந்தகை) எனப் பிரிக்கப்படுகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Based on their underlying morphological root, into which two primary categories are derivative nouns classified?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Particle derivatives and Qualitative derivatives", "B": "Noun-derived agentives (Peyar Aakkappeyar) and Verb-derived agentives (Vinai Aakkappeyar)", "C": "Demonstrative derivatives and Interrogative derivatives", "D": "Substantive nouns and Attribute nouns"}, "explanation": "Derivative nouns are categorized into Noun-derived (nominal root + suffix) and Verb-derived (verbal root + suffix)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 162, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 162", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Grammar", "Aakkappeyarkal"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "grammar_aakkappeyarkal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "epene_suffix_nar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வினையடிகளுடன் பலர்பால் மற்றும் மரியாதைப் பன்மையை உணர்த்தும் '-நர்' விகுதி சேர்ந்து உருவான சரியான சொல் வடிவங்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஓட்டுனர், இயக்குனன், பாடுனன்", "B": "ஓட்டுவான், இயக்குவான், பாடுவான்", "C": "ஓட்டுநர், நடத்துநர், இயக்குநர், பார்வையாளர்", "D": "ஓட்டக்காரன், நடத்தக்காரன், இயக்கக்காரன்"}, "explanation": "ஓட்டு + நர் = ஓட்டுநர், நடத்து + நர் = நடத்துநர், இயக்கு + நர் = இயக்குநர் என அமைவதே சரியான இலக்கண மரபாகும் ('ன'கரப் பயன்பாடு பிழையானது, 'ந'கரமே மரபு)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which forms accurately represent honorific/epicene agentive nouns forged with the agentive formative suffix '-nar'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ottunar (with alveolar na), Iyakkunan, Paadunan", "B": "Ottuvaan, Iyakkuvaan, Paaduvaan", "C": "Ottunar, Nadathunar, Iyakkunar, Paarvaiyaalar (with proper dental na/rhotic endings)", "D": "Ottakkaran, Nadathakkaran, Iyakkakkaran"}, "explanation": "The correct standard grammatical forms are Ottunar, Nadathunar, and Iyakkunar using dental 'na'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 164, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 164", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Grammar", "Aakkappeyarkal"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q148", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "grammar_aakkappeyarkal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "foreign_suffix_influence", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழில் வழங்கிவரும் '-காரன்' மற்றும் '-தார்' போன்ற விகுதிகள் வரலாற்று மொழியியல் நோக்கில் எம்மொழிகளின் தொடர்பால் தமிழில் பரவலாகக் கலந்து ஆக்க விகுதிகளாயின?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சீனம் மற்றும் மலாய்", "B": "கிரேக்கம் மற்றும் இலத்தீன்", "C": "போர்ச்சுகீசியம் மற்றும் பிரெஞ்சு", "D": "பாரசீகம் மற்றும் இந்தி/உருது (ஹிந்துஸ்தானி)"}, "explanation": "'-காரன்' (சமஸ்கிருதம்/பிராகிருதம் வழி இந்தி) மற்றும் '-தார்' (ஜமீன்தார், தாசில்தார், நிலச்சுவான்தார் போன்ற பாரசீக/உருது விகுதிகள்) பிறமொழித் தொடர்பால் தமிழில் ஆக்க விகுதிகளாக நிலைபெற்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "From which language families were suffixes like '-karan' and '-dar' assimilated into Tamil usage through historical administrative contacts?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Chinese and Malay", "B": "Greek and Latin", "C": "Portuguese and French", "D": "Persian and Hindi/Urdu (Hindustani administrative stratum)"}, "explanation": "Suffixes like '-dar' (zamindar) and '-karan' entered colloquial and formal registers through Persian/Hindustani contacts."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 164, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 164", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Grammar", "Aakkappeyarkal"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q149", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "grammar_aakkappeyarkal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aakkappeyar_matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆக்கப்பெயர்களையும் அவற்றின் விகுதிகளையும் பொருத்துக:\n(அ) வினையாளர் - 1. -அகம்\n(ஆ) அறிவாளி - 2. -ஆளன் / -ஆளர்\n(இ) விற்பனையகம் - 3. -காரன்\n(ஈ) வேலைக்காரன் - 4. -ஆளி", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-2, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-3", "B": "அ-4, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-1, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-4", "D": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2"}, "explanation": "வினையாளர் (-ஆளர்), அறிவாளி (-ஆளி), விற்பனையகம் (-அகம்), வேலைக்காரன் (-காரன்) என்பதே சரியான பொருத்தமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the derivative nouns with their corresponding formative suffixes:\n(a) Vinaiyaalar - 1. -aham\n(b) Arivaali - 2. -aalan / -aalar\n(c) Virpanaiyaham - 3. -karan\n(d) Velaikkaran - 4. -aali", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-4, c-1, d-3", "B": "a-4, b-2, c-3, d-1", "C": "a-1, b-3, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2"}, "explanation": "Vinaiyaalar (-aalar), Arivaali (-aali), Virpanaiyaham (-aham), Velaikkaran (-karan)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpora