{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q170", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "padaicherukku_elephant", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"கைவேல் களிற்றொடு போக்கி வருபவன்\nமெய்வேல் பறியா நகும்\" - இக்குறட்பாவில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுப்பொருள் வைப்பணி", "B": "இல்பொருள் உவமையணி", "C": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சியணி", "D": "சிலேடை அணி"}, "explanation": "கையில் இருந்த வேலைத் தன்மீது பாய்ந்துவந்த யானையின் மீது எறிந்துவிட்டு, அடுத்த ஆயுதம் தேடும் வீரன் தன் மார்பில் தைத்துள்ள வேலைக் கண்டு மகிழ்ந்து பறிக்கிறான் என்ற அரிய வீரக்காட்சி 'இல்பொருள் உவமையணி'யாக விளங்கும் பாங்கில் அமைந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What poetic figure of speech (Ani) is deployed in the heroic verse 'Kaivel Kalitrodu Pokki Varubavan Meivel Pariyaa Nagum'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vettruporul Vaippani", "B": "Ilporul Uvamaiyani (Fancy/conceived simile of heroic grandeur)", "C": "Vanchappuhazhchiyani", "D": "Siledai Ani"}, "explanation": "The verse portrays an extraordinary display of chivalric courage classified under Ilporul Uvamaiyani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "Thirukkural", "Padaicherukku"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q171", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "thirukkural_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "amaichu_attributes", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"கருவியும் காலமும் செய்கையும் செய்யும்\nஅருவினையும் மாண்ட தமைச்சு\" - இக்குறட்பாவின்படி ஓர் அமைச்சருக்குரிய கடமைகளாக வள்ளுவர் குறிப்பிடுவன எத்தனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மூன்று", "B": "நான்கு", "C": "ஐந்து (கருவி, காலம், செயல்வகை, அரிய செயல், தக்க முறை)", "D": "ஆறு"}, "explanation": "தொழில் செய்வதற்கு ஏற்ற கருவி, தகுந்த காலம், செய்யும் செயல்வகை, அரிய செயல், அதனைச் செய்துமுடிக்கும் வழி ஆகிய ஐந்திலும் சிறந்தவனே அமைச்சன்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to the verse 'Karuviyum Kaalamum Seygaiyum Seyyum Aruvinaiyum Maanda Thamaichu', how many vital elements must an ideal minister master?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Three", "B": "Four", "C": "Five (Instrument, timing, manner of execution, difficult enterprise, and strategic tact)", "D": "Six"}, "explanation": "Valluvar outlines five cardinal competencies required of a premier minister."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "ter