{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q173", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "glossary_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vocabulary_glossary_match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இயல் 7 கலைச்சொற்களைப் பொருத்துக:\n(அ) Script - 1. தயாரிப்பாளர்\n(ஆ) Producer - 2. தணிக்கை\n(இ) Censorship - 3. நாடகச்சுவடி / படிவ உரை\n(ஈ) Prop - 4. மேடை முட்டுக்கலன்கள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "C": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-4, இ-3, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "Script = நாடகச்சுவடி/படிவ உரை; Producer = தயாரிப்பாளர்; Censorship = தணிக்கை; Prop = மேடை முட்டுக்கலன்கள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the theatrical terms with their standardized Tamil terminology:\n(a) Script - 1. Thayaarippaalar\n(b) Producer - 2. Thanikkai\n(c) Censorship - 3. Naadagachuvadi / Padiva Urai\n(d) Prop - 4. Maedai Muttukkalangal", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-1", "C": "a-4, b-3, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-4, c-3, d-1"}, "explanation": "Script (3), Producer (1), Censorship (2), Prop (4)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", 