{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q174", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "pyq_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_jeeva_quote_tnpsc", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC அசல் வினா] \"என்னை எங்கேனும் ஒரு கிராமத்தில் புதைத்துவிடுங்கள்; என் சமாதியின் மீது ஓர் ஏழை விவசாயி தன் மாடுகளை மேய்த்துவிட்டுப் போகட்டும்\" - என்று நெகிழ்ச்சியுடன் கூறிய தமிழறிஞர்/மக்கள் தலைவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சி. பா. ஆதித்தனார்", "B": "தோழர் ஜீவானந்தம்", "C": "காமராசர்", "D": "அண்ணா"}, "explanation": "எளிய விவசாயிகளுக்காகவும் பாட்டாளி மக்களுக்காகவும் தன் வாழ்நாளெல்லாம் உழைத்த தோழர் ப. ஜீவானந்தம் இவ்வாறு உரைத்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Which renowned public leader expressed: 'Bury me in any humble village; let a destitute peasant graze his cattle upon my grave'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Si. Pa. Adithanar", "B": "Comrade P. Jeevanandham", "C": "Kamarajar", "D": "Anna"}, "explanation": "Comrade Jeeva's self-effacing socialist humility is immortalized in this celebrated declaration."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 146, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 146", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 7", "PYQ", "Jeevanandham"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u7_q175", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "pyq_unit7", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pyq_bharathidasan_title", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC அசல் வினா] கனக சுப்புரத்தினத்திற்கு 'பாரதிதாசன்' என்ற பெயரும், அவரது பில்கணீயத் தழுவல் நூலால் 'புரட்சிக்கவிஞர்' என்ற பட்டமும் யாரால் எப்போது வழங்கப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காந்தியடிகளால்", "B": "திரு. வி. க-வால்", "C": "தந்தை பெரியார் மற்றும் அறிஞர் அண்ணாவால் (1946-ல் பொன்முடிப்பு வழங்கி)", "D": "ராஜாஜியால்"}, "explanation": "1946-ல் அறிஞர் அண்ணா, பெரியார் உள்ளிட்டோர் பாரதிதாசனுக்குத் தலைசிறந்த கவிஞராகப் பாராட்டிப் பொற்கிழி (ரூ. 25,000) வழங்கிப் 'புரட்சிக் கவிஞர்' எனச் சிறப்பித்தனர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] By whom was the historic honorific purse and title 'Puratchik Kavignar' conferred upon Bharathidasan in 1946?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mahatma Gandhi", "B": "Thiru. Vi. Ka.", "C": "Periyar E. V. R. and Arignar Anna (presenting gold purse in 1946)", "D": "Rajaji"}, "explanation": "Periyar and Anna felicitated Bharathidasan with 25,000 gold rupees and the title Puratchi Kavignar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tami